# Per-leg (A/B) split deliberately NOT wired in -- confirmed via
# multiple independent real-world reports (separate users, separate
# Kamailio versions, both on Kamailio's and rtpengine's own issue
# trackers) of a known, still-unresolved bug where per-leg AVPs come
# back null/empty even when the label= flag is set correctly and
# visible in rtpengine's own logs, while the overall min/max/average
